;
; execute — internal/execute's command line (tsc.go and execute/tsc) (phase (b)2).
;
; ★ The reporters are closures upstream (CreateDiagnosticReporter,
; CreateReportErrorSummary); here they are the two booleans they close over —
; quiet and pretty — decided at the same call sites.

